{"ref":"BDB, אַשְׁדּוֹדִי","hw":"אַשְׁדּוֹדִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַשְׁדּוֹדִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent. Ashdodite</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָא׳</span> n.sg. coll. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:3\" href=\"/Joshua.13.3\">Jos 13:3</a>; usually pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">(הָ)אַשְׁדּוֹדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.3\">1 S 5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.6\">6</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.1\">Ne 4:1</a>, and as adj. f. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָשִׁים אשׁדודיות</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.23\">Ne 13:23</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אַשְׁדֳּדִיּוֹת</span>).","next":"BDB, אַשְׁדּוֹדִית","prev":"BDB, אַשְׁדּוֹד"}